# Exclude everything by default, then allow back only what the image build needs.
# Without this the build context includes `target/`, which is tens of gigabytes.
*

# Source and manifests
!/src
!/tests
!build.rs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rustfmt.toml

# Needed by build.rs: vergen derives the version string from git metadata
!/.git

# Copied into the runtime stage
!LICENSE-*
!README.md
